===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₃ed- (bite)}}
From {{inh|en|enm|tothe}}, {{m|enm|toth}}, {{m|enm|tooth}}, from {{inh|en|ang|tōþ||tooth}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*tanþ}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*tanþs||tooth}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*h₃dónts||tooth}}. Related to {{m|en|tusk}}. {{doublet|en|dent|dens|tind|tine}}.

